{"4521510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pokorama", "steam_appid": 4521510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5069610], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/dcbdccb572e2b470c05fd0f6b78e322b.poster.avif?t=1786703010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/dcbdccb572e2b470c05fd0f6b78e322b.webm?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/dcbdccb572e2b470c05fd0f6b78e322b.mp4?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every client sees beauty differently. As the owner of a boutique interior decorating studio, it’s your job to transform ordinary spaces into personalized interiors that match each client’s taste, lifestyle, and expectations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with colors, textures, and materials to create spaces your clients will truly connect with while growing your reputation as a designer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Understand your clients</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on projects from clients with unique preferences and design challenges. Some dream of cozy spaces, while others are drawn to bold aesthetics. Balance your own creativity with client's expectations to create interiors that fit the people living in them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/90438a5ef00225e766c4beaa90874c12.poster.avif?t=1786703010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/90438a5ef00225e766c4beaa90874c12.webm?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/90438a5ef00225e766c4beaa90874c12.mp4?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experiment with materials and styles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of paints, fabrics, materials, and textures as you experiment with colors, patterns, and combinations. With complete creative freedom, every project becomes a chance to discover new styles and bring your ideas to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/59620e7f6f20db99088fdcf09950d386.poster.avif?t=1786703010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/59620e7f6f20db99088fdcf09950d386.webm?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/59620e7f6f20db99088fdcf09950d386.mp4?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve creative challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every project comes with its own constraints and expectations. Balance creativity with your clients’ practical and aesthetic needs, adapt to different styles and requirements, and turn challenging briefs into beautiful interiors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/e99dcc3bc529ce8c6ab82bc555c3a1f5.poster.avif?t=1786703010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/e99dcc3bc529ce8c6ab82bc555c3a1f5.webm?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/e99dcc3bc529ce8c6ab82bc555c3a1f5.mp4?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow your studio</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn reputation points and credits for successful projects and buy new materials to expand your collection. Take on more advanced designs, satisfy increasingly demanding clients, and grow your career as a sought-after interior designer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/3f0c75729ba740fa5b7122f3d900a0d8.poster.avif?t=1786703010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/3f0c75729ba740fa5b7122f3d900a0d8.webm?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/3f0c75729ba740fa5b7122f3d900a0d8.mp4?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your designer portfolio </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a portfolio you'll be proud of. Customize layouts, feature your favorite interior shots, refine the text, and add stylish effects to showcase and celebrate your work as an interior designer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/f401f92598680ce4b139f2eb0175940d.poster.avif?t=1786703010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/f401f92598680ce4b139f2eb0175940d.webm?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/f401f92598680ce4b139f2eb0175940d.mp4?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature bullets</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse client projects:</strong> Face unique preferences and design challenges that test your ability to balance personal creativity with your clients’ expectations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vast material library:</strong> Dive into paints, fabrics, and textures, allowing you to experiment with colors, mix and match patterns, and create new combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic scoring and verdicts:</strong> Experience how every material, color, and texture choice directly impacts your final project score and client feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career progression system:</strong> Earn reputation points for successful projects to unlock new materials, take on advanced jobs, and satisfy demanding clients.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable project portfolio:</strong> Select custom layouts, curate your favorite interior shots, adjust text, and add unique effects to showcase your design talent.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/dcbdccb572e2b470c05fd0f6b78e322b.poster.avif?t=1786703010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/dcbdccb572e2b470c05fd0f6b78e322b.webm?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/dcbdccb572e2b470c05fd0f6b78e322b.mp4?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every client sees beauty differently. As the owner of a boutique interior decorating studio, it’s your job to transform ordinary spaces into personalized interiors that match each client’s taste, lifestyle, and expectations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with colors, textures, and materials to create spaces your clients will truly connect with while growing your reputation as a designer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Understand your clients</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on projects from clients with unique preferences and design challenges. Some dream of cozy spaces, while others are drawn to bold aesthetics. Balance your own creativity with client's expectations to create interiors that fit the people living in them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/90438a5ef00225e766c4beaa90874c12.poster.avif?t=1786703010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/90438a5ef00225e766c4beaa90874c12.webm?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/90438a5ef00225e766c4beaa90874c12.mp4?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experiment with materials and styles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of paints, fabrics, materials, and textures as you experiment with colors, patterns, and combinations. With complete creative freedom, every project becomes a chance to discover new styles and bring your ideas to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/59620e7f6f20db99088fdcf09950d386.poster.avif?t=1786703010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/59620e7f6f20db99088fdcf09950d386.webm?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/59620e7f6f20db99088fdcf09950d386.mp4?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve creative challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every project comes with its own constraints and expectations. Balance creativity with your clients’ practical and aesthetic needs, adapt to different styles and requirements, and turn challenging briefs into beautiful interiors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/e99dcc3bc529ce8c6ab82bc555c3a1f5.poster.avif?t=1786703010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/e99dcc3bc529ce8c6ab82bc555c3a1f5.webm?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/e99dcc3bc529ce8c6ab82bc555c3a1f5.mp4?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow your studio</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn reputation points and credits for successful projects and buy new materials to expand your collection. Take on more advanced designs, satisfy increasingly demanding clients, and grow your career as a sought-after interior designer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/3f0c75729ba740fa5b7122f3d900a0d8.poster.avif?t=1786703010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/3f0c75729ba740fa5b7122f3d900a0d8.webm?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/3f0c75729ba740fa5b7122f3d900a0d8.mp4?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your designer portfolio </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a portfolio you'll be proud of. Customize layouts, feature your favorite interior shots, refine the text, and add stylish effects to showcase and celebrate your work as an interior designer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/f401f92598680ce4b139f2eb0175940d.poster.avif?t=1786703010\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/f401f92598680ce4b139f2eb0175940d.webm?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4521510/extras/f401f92598680ce4b139f2eb0175940d.mp4?t=1786703010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature bullets</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse client projects:</strong> Face unique preferences and design challenges that test your ability to balance personal creativity with your clients’ expectations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vast material library:</strong> Dive into paints, fabrics, and textures, allowing you to experiment with colors, mix and match patterns, and create new combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic scoring and verdicts:</strong> Experience how every material, color, and texture choice directly impacts your final project score and client feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career progression system:</strong> Earn reputation points for successful projects to unlock new materials, take on advanced jobs, and satisfy demanding clients.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable project portfolio:</strong> Select custom layouts, curate your favorite interior shots, adjust text, and add unique effects to showcase your design talent.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Run a boutique decorating studio where every client has unique tastes, quirks and expectations. Experiment with paints, fabrics and textures to create interiors your clients will love (or not), build your reputation, and unlock beautiful materials and interiors as your studio grows.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a